# Authorized Ed25519 client keys
# Generate a compact client key, then derive its public entry with tunnel-rs:
# tunnel-rs generate-auth-key "alice laptop" > client.key
# tunnel-rs show-auth-key --private-key-file client.key >> authorized_keys
#
# Format: ed25519-pub:<unpadded url-safe base64 32-byte public key>[ comment]
# Whitespace separates the key from the comment, which runs to end of line.
# ed25519-pub:1bhGIken5UAXTkC7cABRzM4cE98xZl3tilGyYZsoyP8 alice laptop
